---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About" description="What EarlySpawn is and how we check game codes.">
  <div class="wrap prose page">
    <h1>About {site.name}</h1>
    <p>{site.name} covers the games gaining players fastest, with codes, beginner guides, and game info in one place. We cover new games early, often before the bigger sites get to them.</p>
    <h2>How we check codes</h2>
    <p>Every code on this site comes from the game's own announcements, and we check it in-game before listing it. Each codes page shows when it was last checked. Codes that stop working move to the expired list.</p>
    <h2>Spotted a new code?</h2>
    <p>Send it to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we'll check it and add it.</p>
    <p>{site.name} is a fan site. It isn't affiliated with or endorsed by Roblox Corporation or any game developer.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>.page { padding-top: 36px; } .page h1 { margin-bottom: 18px; }</style>
